# The menus on a desktop window: How to play, Settings (the palette and the
# left-handed pad), the Daily started, paused by Escape, restarted and left,
# Hosted play signed out, and the Learn list's "Claim land" lesson played by
# keys (up, left, down, right back home) to its results.
# viewport 1280x800@1
until 600 Territory Trail
frames 60
click =Help
until 300 Cross a rival
frames 10
save tt-help
click =Close
frames 10
click =Settings
until 300 Color palette
frames 10
click =Left-handed controls
frames 10
save tt-settings
click =Done
frames 10
click Daily Challenge
until 300 One shared seed for everyone today
frames 240
save tt-daily
key Escape 1
until 300 =Paused
frames 10
save tt-paused
click =Restart
until 300 One shared seed for everyone today
frames 240
key Escape 1
until 300 =Paused
frames 10
click =Leave round
until 300 New here?
frames 10
click =Hosted Play
until 300 needs a StarHermit
frames 10
save tt-hosted-guest
click =Back
until 300 New here?
frames 10
click =Learn
until 300 Claim land
frames 10
click Claim land
until 300 Loop back into your own territory
frames 240
key ArrowUp 1
frames 40
key ArrowLeft 1
frames 10
key ArrowDown 1
frames 45
key ArrowRight 1
until 900 =Lesson complete.
frames 30
save tt-claim-results
expect Victory
